      </li>
      <li>Click <strong>Edit </strong><em><strong>application-name</strong></em> to see the <strong>Add</strong> workflow you used to create the application. The form is pre-populated with the values you had added while creating the application.</li>
      <li>
      Edit the necessary values for the application.
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
        <AlertTitle>Note</AlertTitle>
        <AlertDescription>
          <p>You cannot edit the <strong>Name</strong> field in the <strong>General</strong> section, the CI/CD pipelines, or the <strong>Create a route to the application</strong> field in the <strong>Advanced Options</strong> section.</p>
        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      </li>
